  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0">Declare FULL. Read 088's script and 099's step-0 code. Confirm the Defender tag (researcher).</step>
    <step order="1">Move and extend the gateway; SessionFileBlobStore tests green unchanged.</step>
    <step order="2">StoredFileService, options, DI.</step>
    <step order="3">Route, filter, handler with the audit event.</step>
